Subject: [PATCH] Day 1: real imagery + expanded catalog

- Replaced blank 'no image' placeholders with branded tiles (each category
  gets a distinct color from the site's own design tokens, generated via
  placehold.co) so products always show something intentional
- Catalog expanded from 12 products / 4 categories to 36 products across
  8 categories: Electronics, Apparel, Home & Kitchen, Sports & Fitness,
  Books, Beauty & Personal Care, Groceries, Toys & Games
- Stock levels deliberately varied per category (some out of stock, some
  low stock) so the stamp badges are visible across a real demo browse,
  not just on one or two items
---
